    feat(metrics): add per-solve observability and host-pressure skip tracking (DF-OFF-BY-ONE-32)
    
    - Add internal/metrics package with Observer for recording solve metrics
      (peak RSS, wall time, test runs, killed flag) and host-pressure skips
    - Wire Observer into cron loop: RecordSkip on idle gate trip, RecordHost
      on healthy probe, RecordSolve on solve completion/failure
    - Add GET /metrics endpoint to API server for querying snapshots
    - Add unit tests for metrics package (Observer, Snapshot, over-budget alert)
    - Add integration tests for cron loop observer wiring
    
    Fixes DF-OFF-BY-ONE-32: host-aware feeder gate + per-solve metrics
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
